{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24514","headline":"开成大行皇帝挽歌词四首奉敕撰进 四 · 白居易","name":"开成大行皇帝挽歌词四首奉敕撰进 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"化成同轨表清平，恩结连枝感圣明。\n帝与九龄虽吉梦，山呼万岁是虚声。\n月低仪仗辞兰路，风引笳箫入柏城。\n老病龙髯攀不及，东周退傅最伤情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}